# armour/shared/pauldron_feather5_l: the great FEATHER pauldron on the left shoulder (feather.5; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a feather mantle grown great: overlapping rows of feathers over the shoulder and the collar, each row lit along
# its top, the foot ragged in feather tips (the MANTLE mass in the people's cloth).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
